---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { ui, type Locale } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
import { pageUrl } from '../../lib/urls';
const { locale } = Astro.props as { locale: Locale };
const t = ui[locale];
---
<BaseLayout locale={locale} title={t.about} description={t.aboutDescription} path="about">
  <section class="container about-page">
    <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">{t.about}</p><h1 class="multiline">{t.aboutTitle}</h1><p>{t.aboutDescription}</p></header>
    <div class="about-columns">
      <div class="prose">
        {locale === 'en' ? <>
          <h2>Following the work, one question at a time</h2>
          <p>This is a personal exploration of small turbojet design, beginning with the KJ66. I want to connect original source material, CAD reconstruction, analysis, manufacturing, and testing through a clear record of the work.</p>
          <p>The notebook is where that process will be shared: the question behind a drawing, the reason for a model change, a comparison that clarifies a decision, and the details that remain unresolved.</p>
          <h2>A record that can grow</h2>
          <p>Each article will focus on one problem or milestone. Images and explanations will sit together, with relevant calculations, source references, and downloadable files added when they are ready.</p>
          <p>The opening article explains the choice of KJ66 and presents the R3 reconstruction. Some later investigations remain editorial previews. Simulation results and measurements will identify their revision and conditions when they become available. The current task is to organize drawing versions, source information, and interfaces that need verification.</p>
          <h2>Begin with the project</h2>
          <p>The <a href={pageUrl(locale, 'build-log/starting-the-project')}>starting note</a> sets out the intended journey. The build log will follow it as the engine project develops.</p>
        </> : <>
          <h2>围绕具体问题，记录探索过程</h2>
          <p>这是一个从 KJ66 出发的小型涡喷发动机个人探索项目。我希望用清楚的记录，把原始资料、CAD 重建、分析、制造与测试连接起来。</p>
          <p>手记将分享这个过程：图纸背后的问题、模型变化的原因、帮助理解决定的比较，以及仍未解决的细节。</p>
          <h2>一份逐步增长的记录</h2>
          <p>每篇文章围绕一个问题或阶段成果展开。图片与解释放在一起，相关计算、资料来源与可下载文件将在准备好后加入。</p>
          <p>开篇文章介绍选择 KJ66 的理由与 R3 重建模型，部分后续调查仍是内容预览。仿真结果与测量数据将在获得后明确标注版本和条件。当前工作是整理图纸版本、资料依据与待核实接口。</p>
          <h2>从项目起点开始</h2>
          <p><a href={pageUrl(locale, 'build-log/starting-the-project')}>开篇笔记</a>介绍了计划中的旅程。制作日志会随着发动机项目逐步更新。</p>
        </>}
      </div>
      <aside class="author-card"><span class="author-monogram" aria-hidden="true">z.</span><p class="eyebrow">{t.by}</p><h2>{site.author}</h2><p>{t.footerText}</p><a class="text-link" href={site.github}>{t.githubProfile}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
